# This repository is public. A run over a non-public repository never leaves the machine it ran on:
# its config, its log and its artifacts all stay under <gate>/internal/, which git never sees. Its report
# row in <gate>/report.md carries a label, counts and codes only (see README.md § What may be committed).
/*/internal/

# A log holds the machine's own paths (the venv, the checkouts, the output). Kept locally, never committed.
local-integration.log
